  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-currency-and-oil",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：货币与石油价格服务\n\nZenrus MCP Server 是一个提供实时货币汇率和石油价格的服务器，支持多种计算功能，适用于金融分析和自动化工具集成。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **get_usd_rate** — Get current USD/RUB exchange rate from zenrus.ru\n- **get_eur_rate** — Get current EUR/RUB exchange rate from zenrus.ru\n- **get_brent_usd_rate** — Get current Brent crude oil price in USD per barrel from zenrus.ru\n- **get_brent_rub_rate** — Get current Brent crude oil price in RUB per barrel from zenrus.ru\n- **calculate_barrels_for_rub** — Calculate how many barrels of Brent crude oil can be purchased for a given amount in Russian Rubles\n- **calculate_barrels_for_usd** — Calculate how many barrels of Brent crude oil can be purchased for a given amount in US Dollars\n- **calculate_barrels_for_eur** — Calculate how many barrels of Brent crude oil can be purchased for a given amount in Euros"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-currency-and-oil\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-currency-and-oil\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
